Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:07.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,CardioWave DSP is a synthetic twelve lead E C G workbench that runs the whole signal chain in one page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:14.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everything is computed in the browser, deterministically, with zero dependencies and no network.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:22.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,A seeded generator builds the beat interval series with Mayer wave and respiration components.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:32.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twelve coupled McSharry oscillators integrate on a fourth order Runge Kutta stepper, then project through a twelve by five amplitude matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:41.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mains hum, baseline wander and band limited E M G noise join per lead, while the ground truth beats stay known by construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:48.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,One click generates and analyses a record, scoring two detectors against that truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:58.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,A single lead two Pan Tompkins chain band passes, differentiates, squares and integrates over a one hundred twenty millisecond window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.61,0:01:06.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,A twelve lead voting ensemble clusters detections and refines each survivor on the spatial magnitude trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:14.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,The stat grid reports sensitivity, precision, F one and timing R M S E at a one hundred fifty millisecond tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,The signal tab draws all twelve leads, the Butterworth magnitude response, and the Pan Tompkins stages from filtered wave to detection envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:36.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,Back on the bench, a live Poincare plot marks each beat pair with its S D one S D two ellipse, and the rhythm card classifies the strip by deterministic rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:46.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,H R V analysis reports time domain stats, Poincare geometry and a Welch power spectral density with L F and H F band powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:02:00.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,The evaluation tab runs a nine case benchmark across rates, sampling rates and noise, measures the real filter response at six probe frequencies, and names seven known failure modes in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.65,0:02:11.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,The export tab writes PhysioNet W F D B compatible header, signal and annotation text, plus a clinical strip and an S H A 256 fingerprinted report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:18.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three hundred thirty six Node tests pass with zero failures, re verified inside this recording run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:24.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,CardioWave DSP. Synthetic signals, honest scores, education and research only.
